{"id":"261de7e0269cd7e2","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-bounded-linear.md","title":"Bounded Linear Operator","display":"df-bounded-linear — Bounded Linear Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-bounded-linear","aliases":["58-df-bounded-linear","Bounded Linear Operator"],"display":"df-bounded-linear — Bounded Linear Operator","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-normed-vector.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-bounded-linear"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-bounded-linear</span><span>Bounded Linear Operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bounded-linear — Bounded Linear Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md\">../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7da44596b6c13df1\" href=\"?note=7da44596b6c13df1\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-normed-vector.md\">../batch06/58-df-normed-vector.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,X,Y,K,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y\\in V\">\\(T,X,Y,K,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NormedVectorSpace}_S(X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\">\\(\\operatorname{NormedVectorSpace}_S(X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NormedVectorSpace}_S(Y,K,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\">\\(\\operatorname{NormedVectorSpace}_S(Y,K,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7da44596b6c13df1\" href=\"?note=7da44596b6c13df1\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-normed-vector.md\">../batch06/58-df-normed-vector.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,X,Y,K,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,X,Y,K,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md\">../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\\)</span>（本文件定义）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{X,Y}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{X,Y}(T)\\)</span> 是指定上述结构数据时的兼容记号</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}linear} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_S(T,X,Y,K,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\operatorname{NormedVectorSpace}_S(X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\land\\operatorname{NormedVectorSpace}_S(Y,K,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,X,Y,K,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathbb{R}_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\|T(x)\\|_Y\\leq M\\|x\\|_X)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}linear} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_S(T,X,Y,K,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\operatorname{NormedVectorSpace}_S(X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\land\\operatorname{NormedVectorSpace}_S(Y,K,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,X,Y,K,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathbb{R}_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\|T(x)\\|_Y\\leq M\\|x\\|_X)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}linear\\text{-}compat} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{X,Y}(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_S(T,X,Y,K,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}linear\\text{-}compat} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{X,Y}(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_S(T,X,Y,K,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bounded: norm of output bounded by constant times norm of input</li>\n<li>在同一对赋范结构固定后，有界性等价于线性映射在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 处连续；这属于后续定理而非本定义的一部分。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Functional Analysis</li>\n<li>Conway, A Course in Functional Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-normed-vector.md","status":"resolved","id":"7da44596b6c13df1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-normed-vector.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-normed-vector.md","status":"resolved","id":"7da44596b6c13df1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{NormedVectorSpace}_S(X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cd